(4710801, 679819, 84520, '<td valign="top">I really want one of these!  I have a Moskva-5 that always blows my mind when I finish developing the film it shoots, and I''ve heard great things about the 35mm Kiev''s.<br/> <br/>Also, you have some pretty good looking polaroids there.  You should upload them so we can check them out :)</td>', 'I really want one of these!  I have a Moskva-5 that always blows my mind when I finish developing the film it shoots, and I''ve heard great things about the 35mm Kiev''s. Also, you have some pretty good looking polaroids there.  You should upload them so we can check them out :)', '2008-05-19 06:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
