(4711396, 679967, 20577, '<td valign="top">Son, we live in a world that has rules. And those ruless have to be guarded by the site council. They have a greater responsibility than you can possibly fathom. You try to cheat and take pictures of artwork and you curse the site council. You have that luxury. You have the luxury of trying to cheat your way to a good score. Your potential disqualification, while tragic, probably saved you a crappy score. And the site council''s existence, while grotesque and incomprehensible to you, stops cheating... from pigs like you.</td>', 'Son, we live in a world that has rules. And those ruless have to be guarded by the site council. They have a greater responsibility than you can possibly fathom. You try to cheat and take pictures of artwork and you curse the site council. You have that luxury. You have the luxury of trying to cheat your way to a good score. Your potential disqualification, while tragic, probably saved you a crappy score. And the site council''s existence, while grotesque and incomprehensible to you, stops cheating... from pigs like you.', '2008-05-19 13:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
