(4711507, 678964, 67258, '<td valign="top">That is one interesting camera! The texture is well rendered, and the exposure good.  There is some black haloing to the top and sides, which is a shame, and the shiny metal peice seems somewhat out of keeping.  Nonethe less a good entry, and one that is certainly intriguing.</td>', 'That is one interesting camera! The texture is well rendered, and the exposure good.  There is some black haloing to the top and sides, which is a shame, and the shiny metal peice seems somewhat out of keeping.  Nonethe less a good entry, and one that is certainly intriguing.', '2008-05-19 14:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
