(4714142, 679814, 79356, '<td valign="top">Very creative! Love it!</td>', 'Very creative! Love it!', '2008-05-21 04:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4714187, 679749, 65713, '<td valign="top">A  little flat lighting but nice idea with the tripod.</td>', 'A  little flat lighting but nice idea with the tripod.', '2008-05-21 04:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4714270, 679814, 47169, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites from this challenge! Tack-sharp just where it needs to be, a brilliant idea well executed! This definitely says portrait to me with the reflection in the ''eyes'', very nicely done!</td>', 'One of my favourites from this challenge! Tack-sharp just where it needs to be, a brilliant idea well executed! This definitely says portrait to me with the reflection in the ''eyes'', very nicely done!', '2008-05-21 07:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4714279, 679898, 47169, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me think of some of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=45115" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">TOY</a>''s portraits! I think its the water droplets, perfect lighting and framing- a brilliant shot!</td>', 'This shot makes me think of some of  TOY''s portraits! I think its the water droplets, perfect lighting and framing- a brilliant shot!', '2008-05-21 07:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4714676, 679886, 27817, '<td valign="top">Professional. Great comp and concept.</td>', 'Professional. Great comp and concept.', '2008-05-21 10:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715628, 679442, 24486, '<td valign="top">Now that''s what I call dedication!</td>', 'Now that''s what I call dedication!', '2008-05-21 17:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715652, 679891, 90678, '<td valign="top">What a great image; you managed to evoke so much emotion with just the hands.  I was fairly pleased with my entry until I saw your shot and now I feel like Im not even playing in the same game.</td>', 'What a great image; you managed to evoke so much emotion with just the hands.  I was fairly pleased with my entry until I saw your shot and now I feel like Im not even playing in the same game.', '2008-05-21 17:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715657, 679911, 90678, '<td valign="top">Great color and contrast, it really feels 3D.</td>', 'Great color and contrast, it really feels 3D.', '2008-05-21 17:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715660, 679749, 90678, '<td valign="top">Great pose, for some reason it makes me think of "Robbie the Robot".</td>', 'Great pose, for some reason it makes me think of "Robbie the Robot".', '2008-05-21 17:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715666, 678964, 90678, '<td valign="top">I love the look of this capture, it has a very Industrial Revolution feel to it.</td>', 'I love the look of this capture, it has a very Industrial Revolution feel to it.', '2008-05-21 17:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715687, 678497, 90658, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  Beautiful!  Good enogh to be on an add billboard somewhere.  I loved this in both thumbnail and large.</td>', 'Stunning!  Beautiful!  Good enogh to be on an add billboard somewhere.  I loved this in both thumbnail and large.', '2008-05-21 17:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715695, 679724, 90658, '<td valign="top">What does this for me is the use of color.  So many folks went with b&amp;w or silver/gray.  There is a simplicity in the elegance of the color.  I wonder what this looks like tilted 180 degrees...right now the camera is upside down.  Could be distracting, yet perhaps this angle is correct...wish I could turn my monitor on it''s head to figure it out.</td>', 'What does this for me is the use of color.  So many folks went with b&w or silver/gray.  There is a simplicity in the elegance of the color.  I wonder what this looks like tilted 180 degrees...right now the camera is upside down.  Could be distracting, yet perhaps this angle is correct...wish I could turn my monitor on it''s head to figure it out.', '2008-05-21 17:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715702, 678964, 90658, '<td valign="top">The black on black could have ruined this, but there is just enough texture and age on the camera to really be interesting.  The detail captured is perfect.</td>', 'The black on black could have ruined this, but there is just enough texture and age on the camera to really be interesting.  The detail captured is perfect.', '2008-05-21 17:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715731, 679837, 90658, '<td valign="top">My problem with this is editing.  I can still see the strap, so the effect of the camera just floating in the sky is lost.  Either you need more editing to completely get rid of it, or you can just let it be...show off the strap as well as the camera.  Still well done and nice creative idea.</td>', 'My problem with this is editing.  I can still see the strap, so the effect of the camera just floating in the sky is lost.  Either you need more editing to completely get rid of it, or you can just let it be...show off the strap as well as the camera.  Still well done and nice creative idea.', '2008-05-21 17:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715732, 679934, 90658, '<td valign="top">Love this for the color and the ghosting around the camera.</td>', 'Love this for the color and the ghosting around the camera.', '2008-05-21 17:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715733, 678849, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is almost perfect.  The glare of the lights in the lenses and the chrome make the camera seem more modern than the typewriter it is next to.  It seems futuristic as opposed to antique.  Just an observation.  Nice idea.</td>', 'This is almost perfect.  The glare of the lights in the lenses and the chrome make the camera seem more modern than the typewriter it is next to.  It seems futuristic as opposed to antique.  Just an observation.  Nice idea.', '2008-05-21 17:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715739, 678578, 90658, '<td valign="top">Thank you for showing the naturalness of this camera.  It is a beautiful machine without overly tweaking the shot.</td>', 'Thank you for showing the naturalness of this camera.  It is a beautiful machine without overly tweaking the shot.', '2008-05-21 17:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715750, 679814, 90658, '<td valign="top">Nice use of natural light.  You have actually created a personality in this shot, by focusing on the image in the lens.  Some folks might feel that the camera becomes a secondary image because of this choice, but I like it.</td>', 'Nice use of natural light.  You have actually created a personality in this shot, by focusing on the image in the lens.  Some folks might feel that the camera becomes a secondary image because of this choice, but I like it.', '2008-05-21 17:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715754, 679609, 67258, '<td valign="top">Creative and intriguing - a photo to view again and again.</td>', 'Creative and intriguing - a photo to view again and again.', '2008-05-21 17:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4715777, 679688, 67258, '<td valign="top">Looks like Kings College?  Wherever, it provides a super backdrop, with just the right choice of depth of field.</td>', 'Looks like Kings College?  Wherever, it provides a super backdrop, with just the right choice of depth of field.', '2008-05-21 17:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
