(4718256, 679859, 90658, '<td valign="top">My mom had one of these.  I remember standing around waiting for her to find a good cube.  I like that you have placed this off of center and against a complimentary color.</td>', 'My mom had one of these.  I remember standing around waiting for her to find a good cube.  I like that you have placed this off of center and against a complimentary color.', '2008-05-22 20:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4718266, 679848, 90658, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot into a mirror...the words on the camera are inverted.  Sort of reminds me of when I would get back prints from the store and the negatives were procssed backwards.</td>', 'Brilliant shot into a mirror...the words on the camera are inverted.  Sort of reminds me of when I would get back prints from the store and the negatives were procssed backwards.', '2008-05-22 20:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4718267, 678444, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is interesting, in that we have a shot of a camera taking a shot of another camera.  I just wish that there were more color.  This just seems boring to me.</td>', 'This is interesting, in that we have a shot of a camera taking a shot of another camera.  I just wish that there were more color.  This just seems boring to me.', '2008-05-22 20:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4718269, 679584, 90658, '<td valign="top">OOF to my eyes.</td>', 'OOF to my eyes.', '2008-05-22 20:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4718271, 678603, 90658, '<td valign="top">So here''s my problem...without the benefit of a challenge, I would have no idea that this was a camera.  Not saying that the shot doesn''t have merit, I just never would have seen a camera if I saw this in a different environment.  So, if that was your intent...YooHoo!</td>', 'So here''s my problem...without the benefit of a challenge, I would have no idea that this was a camera.  Not saying that the shot doesn''t have merit, I just never would have seen a camera if I saw this in a different environment.  So, if that was your intent...YooHoo!', '2008-05-22 20:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
