(4718414, 679886, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pretty good and an original idea. Two minor nitpicks, however: 1) the tree.  2) you need to trim your fingernails.</td>', 'Pretty good and an original idea. Two minor nitpicks, however: 1) the tree.  2) you need to trim your fingernails.', '2008-05-22 22:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
