(4718425, 679264, 83313, '<td valign="top">A basic camera portrait, and the technicals are almost as perfect as they could be. I like the way the texture of the paint finish is even visible. This could go into an advertising brochure.</td>', 'A basic camera portrait, and the technicals are almost as perfect as they could be. I like the way the texture of the paint finish is even visible. This could go into an advertising brochure.', '2008-05-22 22:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
