(4720039, 678776, 61961, '<td valign="top">Love the orange colors, especially the brighter ones in the back.  Good use of the roll of film to add visual interest.</td>', 'Love the orange colors, especially the brighter ones in the back.  Good use of the roll of film to add visual interest.', '2008-05-23 14:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
