(4721234, 679549, 65858, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the composition is a little odd.  The camera being near-level on the horizon and the white gaps in the left corners throws off the collage feel.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the composition is a little odd.  The camera being near-level on the horizon and the white gaps in the left corners throws off the collage feel.', '2008-05-24 10:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
