(4722824, 679913, 90414, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, and I love that none of the lines are truly vertical. Only the blown out sky draws some attention from the camera.</td>', 'Nice colors, and I love that none of the lines are truly vertical. Only the blown out sky draws some attention from the camera.', '2008-05-25 15:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722833, 679691, 90414, '<td valign="top">I like this idea... it would make a great poster, as it is very dramatic.</td>', 'I like this idea... it would make a great poster, as it is very dramatic.', '2008-05-25 15:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722884, 679442, 10818, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is amazing...great shot.<br/>Looks like a Canon advertisement.</td>', 'Wow, that is amazing...great shot.Looks like a Canon advertisement.', '2008-05-25 17:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722887, 679546, 10818, '<td valign="top">Fantastic visual.  I feel like I am standing there.<br/>Super photo.</td>', 'Fantastic visual.  I feel like I am standing there.Super photo.', '2008-05-25 17:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722912, 679886, 10818, '<td valign="top">Great colors, focus and proportion.</td>', 'Great colors, focus and proportion.', '2008-05-25 17:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722917, 678665, 10818, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot, good focus and lighting.</td>', 'Nice crisp shot, good focus and lighting.', '2008-05-25 17:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722920, 679528, 10818, '<td valign="top">The colors of the camera, the rocks and the rippling water make this a special shot.</td>', 'The colors of the camera, the rocks and the rippling water make this a special shot.', '2008-05-25 17:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722925, 679688, 10818, '<td valign="top">Great set up.  Super focus on the camera and great back ground.</td>', 'Great set up.  Super focus on the camera and great back ground.', '2008-05-25 17:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4722943, 679926, 91776, '<td valign="top">Asahi for ever...</td>', 'Asahi for ever...', '2008-05-25 18:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4723045, 679011, 18897, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. It looks like a rotated product image, some clip art, and some over-the-top photoshop filters applied. Far from a portrait and far from a photograph. Perhaps I''m missing the point, but to me it''s just generally unappealing. Or look at it this way - if you had your portrait taken and someone delivered your rotated head in a flower, would it be what you expected?</td>', 'I don''t get it. It looks like a rotated product image, some clip art, and some over-the-top photoshop filters applied. Far from a portrait and far from a photograph. Perhaps I''m missing the point, but to me it''s just generally unappealing. Or look at it this way - if you had your portrait taken and someone delivered your rotated head in a flower, would it be what you expected?', '2008-05-25 20:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4723062, 679932, 18897, '<td valign="top">That''s a lens, not a camera. And a really bad shot of one at that. Over saturated, over sharpened, over the top in so many ways it becomes hard to tell what I''m looking at. About as far from a portrait as you come in this challenge.</td>', 'That''s a lens, not a camera. And a really bad shot of one at that. Over saturated, over sharpened, over the top in so many ways it becomes hard to tell what I''m looking at. About as far from a portrait as you come in this challenge.', '2008-05-25 20:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4723073, 679546, 18897, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. It''s a pitty the light house doesn''t appear more on the camera display, and you could have lost whatever it is in the lower left part of the image, but still one of my favs in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot. It''s a pitty the light house doesn''t appear more on the camera display, and you could have lost whatever it is in the lower left part of the image, but still one of my favs in this challenge.', '2008-05-25 20:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4723075, 678497, 18897, '<td valign="top">A bit over-staged, it becomes cluttered with all the flowers. The frog was a nice idea, but would have made a better company to the camera by itself I think. Still on the better half of the submissions for this challenge.</td>', 'A bit over-staged, it becomes cluttered with all the flowers. The frog was a nice idea, but would have made a better company to the camera by itself I think. Still on the better half of the submissions for this challenge.', '2008-05-25 20:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4723081, 679817, 18897, '<td valign="top">Ok, I found the camera in there - and I actually think the image is visually appealing. But it''s points off for interpreting the challenge a bit too freely.</td>', 'Ok, I found the camera in there - and I actually think the image is visually appealing. But it''s points off for interpreting the challenge a bit too freely.', '2008-05-25 20:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4723086, 679814, 18897, '<td valign="top">I''m more interested of what''s in your D70 for this one. The portrait in itself is not very appealing, but it''s points up for the reflection. I hope you got a good shot for the Boat challenge while you were there :-)</td>', 'I''m more interested of what''s in your D70 for this one. The portrait in itself is not very appealing, but it''s points up for the reflection. I hope you got a good shot for the Boat challenge while you were there :-)', '2008-05-25 20:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
