(4723675, 679579, 66384, '<td valign="top">This was really my favorite of the challenge. Very original. I understand what you were doing with the mirror, but what I saw when I first looked at it was a sort of portrait gallery, where the small camera was looking at a portrait of an important camera. Probably because of the angle of the frame -- I didn''t see it as a mirror. Anyway, congratulations on a good score, nice placement, and a new addition to your top row.</td>', 'This was really my favorite of the challenge. Very original. I understand what you were doing with the mirror, but what I saw when I first looked at it was a sort of portrait gallery, where the small camera was looking at a portrait of an important camera. Probably because of the angle of the frame -- I didn''t see it as a mirror. Anyway, congratulations on a good score, nice placement, and a new addition to your top row.', '2008-05-26 01:41:43.000000', NULL, 0),
