(4724419, 679480, 67697, '<td valign="top">Another one of yours that I do not understand why it scored so low.  I like how the focus is on the camera in the viewfinder.  I also like the shadow because it lends some kind of eerie feel to the camera as well.  Excellent shot.  Should have scored higher.</td>', 'Another one of yours that I do not understand why it scored so low.  I like how the focus is on the camera in the viewfinder.  I also like the shadow because it lends some kind of eerie feel to the camera as well.  Excellent shot.  Should have scored higher.', '2008-05-26 09:46:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4724423, 678444, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think this is really good.  I love the concept and the clarity on your camera and the one on the lcd screen is good too.  The only think I would have done is played with the brightness/contrast level to get the cameras to bounce out from the background some.  Anyway, nice job!</td>', 'I think this is really good.  I love the concept and the clarity on your camera and the one on the lcd screen is good too.  The only think I would have done is played with the brightness/contrast level to get the cameras to bounce out from the background some.  Anyway, nice job!', '2008-05-26 09:49:38.000000', NULL, 0),
