(4724442, 679011, 67697, '<td valign="top">It''s a cute idea and I cannot believe all the work you put into creating the background lol.  You will find in time that voters do not like artsy filters here beyond either Photomatix or any HDR stuff.  I cannot give a good answer as to why tho even tho I can point you to one comment that I got a long time ago that would give you some idea about it.  Good luck on future challenges!</td>', 'It''s a cute idea and I cannot believe all the work you put into creating the background lol.  You will find in time that voters do not like artsy filters here beyond either Photomatix or any HDR stuff.  I cannot give a good answer as to why tho even tho I can point you to one comment that I got a long time ago that would give you some idea about it.  Good luck on future challenges!', '2008-05-26 09:56:09.000000', NULL, 0),
