(4724697, 678497, 24454, '<td valign="top">I''m always so amazed by people who get such great pictures of frogs, little and big.  I''ve never been able to see one that sat still long enough to even get a blurry photo - much less get all posed, situated . . . . or shoot . . . Cheegirl puts fake eyelashes on them sometimes :) <br/> <br/>Anyway. . .all my respect and hat bowing off to you miss LydiaToo!  This is awesome!<br/> <br/>And BLESS you for saving the little fellow :)<br/></td>', 'I''m always so amazed by people who get such great pictures of frogs, little and big.  I''ve never been able to see one that sat still long enough to even get a blurry photo - much less get all posed, situated . . . . or shoot . . . Cheegirl puts fake eyelashes on them sometimes :)  Anyway. . .all my respect and hat bowing off to you miss LydiaToo!  This is awesome! And BLESS you for saving the little fellow :)', '2008-05-26 11:38:33.000000', NULL, 0),
