(4726549, 679442, 30791, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> And just how did that poor little guy get back to his peeps in the ''hood from whence he came??  Homewrecker!  At least you didn''t freeze him.  :-)  ''Grats on another one and on not ruining a camera in the process. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>at least he didnt eat him</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: And just how did that poor little guy get back to his peeps in the ''hood from whence he came??  Homewrecker!  At least you didn''t freeze him.  :-)  ''Grats on another one and on not ruining a camera in the process.   at least he didnt eat him', '2008-05-26 23:59:17.000000', NULL, 0),
