(4727525, 679749, 67145, '<td valign="top">when i looked thru the challenge during voting this is the one i liked the most and i reckon had the most impact ..  its bloody brilliant .. !! .. CONGRATULATIONS ON YOUR FIRST RIBBON (which is hard to fathom, you being such an excellent photographer and processing genius  .. when i noticed this on my home page this morning .. its 4.22am .. and saw it was yours, i just assumed it was another ribbon among many  .. obviously after all my visits to your portfolio i''d actually know .. i''ll blame my remiss-ness on an extremely bad memory and the earlyness of the hour) ..  <br/>love the b&amp;w .. love the idea .. love the entire image .. !!.. :)</td>', 'when i looked thru the challenge during voting this is the one i liked the most and i reckon had the most impact ..  its bloody brilliant .. !! .. CONGRATULATIONS ON YOUR FIRST RIBBON (which is hard to fathom, you being such an excellent photographer and processing genius  .. when i noticed this on my home page this morning .. its 4.22am .. and saw it was yours, i just assumed it was another ribbon among many  .. obviously after all my visits to your portfolio i''d actually know .. i''ll blame my remiss-ness on an extremely bad memory and the earlyness of the hour) ..  love the b&w .. love the idea .. love the entire image .. !!.. :)', '2008-05-27 15:28:29.000000', NULL, 0),
