(4832855, 679797, 30982, '<td valign="top">I would have expected this to have scored higher.  I really like the fact that it has grain to it - makes perfect sense for a portrait of a camera.  And nice work with the conversion to B&amp;W.  I may have to try that shooting on glass thing, if I can find some opaque glass.  I think this worked very well!</td>', 'I would have expected this to have scored higher.  I really like the fact that it has grain to it - makes perfect sense for a portrait of a camera.  And nice work with the conversion to B&W.  I may have to try that shooting on glass thing, if I can find some opaque glass.  I think this worked very well!', '2008-07-18 18:29:11.000000', NULL, 0),
